WEBVTT

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.030
Hey, wanna stop by some place on our way home?

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.860
I want to go to the arcade, then!

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.240
Really? The arcade?

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.820
There's a plushie I want.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.700
Sure, let's go.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.620
Yay!

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.160
I haven't been to an arcade in ages!

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.460
--Arcade...
--Neither have I.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.040
I'm gonna get that plushie!

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.250
What did you want to get?

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.670
Well, there's this bear...

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.050
U-Um...

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.050
Hm?

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.880
I have to talk...

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.850
Never mind.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:57.990
It's hard expressing how you feel sometimes.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.920
That's especially true for me.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.970
"I want to be friends with you."

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.890
There's a huge obstacle in the way
for me to even say that.

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:26.390
What's up?

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.900
She's an upperclassman.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:33.780
I'm scared.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.690
Hey, I'm not scary.

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:39.110
You seemed sorta down,
so I wanted to check on you.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.370
A coupon for Joypoli!

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.500
That place is great, isn't it?!

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.500
Please go with your friends.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.050
Then let's go together!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:02.720
--This was the first time I was
able to connect with someone.
--Come on! Let's go!

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:08.730
And now, I want to connect
with even more people.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.980
I can still change.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:21.370
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:26.500
"Nijigasaki High School Idol Club"
"Love Live!"

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.130
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:37.130
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:42.050
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.810
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:47.810
<i>And our hearts start to well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:52.190
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:57.690
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:59.900
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:03.490
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.660
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:11.460
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.130
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.340
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.010
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:22.470
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.800
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.180
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.390
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.810
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.480
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:41.530
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.490
Rinari! They're coming at us.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.790
On it.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.750
Save me!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.500
I'll be right there, Yu-<i>chan</i>!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.130
I'm coming to back you up right now.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.550
Leave this to Ai-<i>san</i>!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.180
That was so much fun!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:08.140
I came here when I was little, but now,
they even have something like this.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.810
You two were really good!

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.810
I come here all the time with Rinari.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.020
Are you good at these?

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.320
I love video games.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:22.780
I didn't do that great today,
but let's come here again!

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.530
--Okay.
--What should we do next?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.070
Tennoji-<i>san</i>?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.830
Hey, it is Tennoji-<i>san</i>.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.040
Friends of yours?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.450
Classmates.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.170
Wait, is that Ai-<i>senpai</i>?!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.500
--Ayumu-<i>chan</i>?!
--Huh? Yes...

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:42.300
I saw your School Idol Club PVs!
Ai-<i>senpai</i>, you're awesome!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.220
Ooh, thanks!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.350
You're so cute, Ayumu-<i>chan</i>!
I'm totally a fan now!

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.680
I've never had someone tell me that in person.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:52.930
I'm so happy.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.810
So cute!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.570
We saw yours, too, Tennoji-<i>san</i>.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.940
Meow!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.190
Hup!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.030
Hello. I'm Rina Tennoji.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.990
That character is great.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.160
Yeah! I love how it moves.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.330
Did you come to check out
the stage here for a possible concert?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.660
Concert?

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:20.340
Joypolis's stage. They're doing
school idol concerts lately.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:24.090
Apparently, Shinonome Academy that's nearby
had a performance here last week.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.010
Huh... I see.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.180
We would love to see all of you perform soon!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.760
I'd love to see you, too!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.640
You guys should totally do a concert!

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.980
--I want to be friends with them...
--Please!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.060
I will.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.780
I'm going to do a concert here.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:45.780
What?! A concert?!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.990
Yeah.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.740
Well, this is rather sudden.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:57.210
I know I have a lot of stuff to work on,
but I want everyone to see it.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:02.000
And I ended up using that character in my PV.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.550
My classmates liked it,

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:10.680
but that's not the real me.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.350
Should I not do it?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.020
Go for it.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.140
You have to decide for yourself, Rina-<i>chan</i>.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:21.560
I'll support whatever you
decide to do, Rina-<i>san</i>.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:26.940
Yes. I think it's very important that
you want to challenge yourself like this.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.070
Yeah.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.990
So when are you planning to do this?

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.580
They happened to have a day open up.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.160
It's next Saturday.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.960
That really is sudden!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.500
Now, now...

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.380
I'll help, too!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.670
Are you sure?

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.170
I'm gonna help, too.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.880
M-Me, too!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.970
I will also help, of course.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:51.390
So basically, we're all supporting her.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.810
Thank you.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.350
It looks like they'll somewhat

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.560
be able to accommodate how we
want to set up this performance.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.940
I'll make the visuals myself.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.190
You are pretty great at that, Rinari.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.530
Mm.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:09.700
But...

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.780
I'm not confident about my performance.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.830
So I want you to teach me.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:27.420
She seems more flexible now.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.800
Well, she has been stretching every day.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.550
Yeah.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:34.140
Open your mouth really wide.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.410
--Zzz...
--Kanata-<i>san</i>?!

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.460
She's asleep?

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.290
What should we do, Shizuko?!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:11.840
Hello! Today, Kasumin's going to
cast a spell on everyone in the venue

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.800
to make you all crazy about me!

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.100
--Yeah! Yeah!
--I already am!

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:18.140
You've got this, Kasukasu!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:21.020
Please don't call me Kasukasu! Hmph!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.060
What exactly are we practicing?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.770
MCing.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:31.280
Um... Thank you very much for coming today.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:35.780
I'm going to try to get better step by step,
so please continue to support me.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.830
Ayumu! You're as cute as ever!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:39.700
So cute!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:40.830
You're making me blush...

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.370
And that's exactly what makes you so cute!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:49.590
Grr... Kasumin's not going to lose
when it comes to cuteness!

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.590
This seems hard.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.550
Oh, right...

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.180
Well, there are instances where
concerts don't have MC sections.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.310
Would you rather not have one
for this performance?

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.220
No, I want to.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:08.360
This time, I'm not going to let things
I can't usually do get in my way.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.400
Understood.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.610
This is where you live, Rina-<i>chan</i>?

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:18.780
Yeah.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:24.410
I made some visuals for the concert,
so I wanted to get your opinions.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.750
Wait, you opened it with your smartphone?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:36.130
I've made it so I can do most of
the things around the house with this.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.770
I guess you're good with tech, too.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.060
Yeah.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:54.070
Ever since I was little, I was never able to
express myself, so I never had any friends.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:58.070
I had to figure out how to play on my own.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:01.620
So when I got into high school,

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:06.540
I never thought that my days would be
filled with so much excitement.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:10.830
I never thought I could change so much.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.880
I'm really grateful for all of you.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.970
I'll do my best.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:26.060
Let's make your concert a huge success!

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.060
Yeah.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.440
--One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.320
--That's right.
--One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.900
I'm not...

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.110
...who I used to be anymore.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.880
Meow! Twirl!

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:56.260
Rina Tennoji has a concert coming up!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.760
The venue will be Tokyo Joypolis.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:02.140
I hope all of you can make it! Meow!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:06.390
Your dance is getting better, Rinako.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:07.730
Is it?

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:10.730
Yes. Keep up the good work.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.650
--Okay.
--Ah, Tennoji-<i>san</i>!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.400
You're practicing really hard.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.110
The concert is this week, right?

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.690
I saw your new video!

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.280
--It was so cute!
--Now that I've changed...

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.790
Would you...

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.080
If you don't mind...

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.050
Tennoji-<i>san</i>?

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.800
Never mind.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.060
Rina-<i>san</i>?

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.600
I'm going home for the day.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.400
I...

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.740
I... can never change.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.250
Shall we start practice?

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:15.250
--But Rina-<i>chan</i> isn't...
--She's not coming.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.840
She's not answering her phone.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:23.510
But why?! Her performance is tomorrow!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.800
She was working so hard for it.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.100
This is Rina-<i>chan</i>'s decision.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.640
Why don't we call it for the day?

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.310
Huh?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:36.900
Are you being mopey, Karin-<i>chan</i>?

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.440
Why would I be?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.070
You were trying to make sure you didn't
get any modeling work tomorrow.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.910
You were looking forward to
Rina-<i>chan</i>'s concert tomorrow, huh?

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.370
I-I was just curious as to how it'd turn out.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:55.920
Are you sure? Aw, I guess you have
a cute side, too, Karin-<i>senpai</i>.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.170
Hush.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.050
Eek! Pwease forgwive mwe!

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.260
I'll be back!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.800
Huh? Ai-<i>senpai</i>?

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.380
--Me, too!
--Yu-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:07.300
Where are you all going?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.680
To find Rina-<i>san</i>!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.560
Huh?!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:13.430
Well, we can't just leave her alone.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:16.270
I guess you're all going.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.810
Are you not?

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.320
Of course I am.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.830
Rinari, are you here?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:41.090
Ai-<i>san</i>! I'm not sure if you should just
randomly go shouting "Rinari"...

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:46.720
Oh, my bad. I heard Rinari's
usually here alone around this time.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.390
I think I just heard Rina-<i>chan</i>'s voice.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:51.930
Really?

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.220
Rinari!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.100
Can we talk for a sec?

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.910
P-Pardon us...

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.950
Rina-<i>chan</i>?

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.500
I'm right here.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.120
Wait, why a cardboard box?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.170
Rinari.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:28.180
I'm sorry for not coming to practice.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:31.600
Yeah. You really had us worried.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.890
What's wrong?

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:38.770
I was just so embarrassed with myself.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:42.690
I hadn't changed at all.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:47.530
Even though I'm having fun,
people just think I'm mad.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:53.120
I just want to be friends
with people, but never could.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.450
I still don't have any friends in class.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:59.870
It's all my fault.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.790
I know that I need to work on that,

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:05.210
so I wanted to change
once I got into high school.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:08.300
At first, it didn't work out.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.850
But then I met Ai-<i>san</i>.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:18.230
And I found out how amazing school idols are.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:23.310
I thought I'd try to change one more time.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:27.190
I thought even I could change
if I could become a school idol

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.900
who connects with so many people through songs.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:35.870
But... and I know you might not
think this is a big deal...

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:41.370
...but I can't help but worry
about my expression.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:44.880
Because that's what's always made me fail.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:52.010
I just can't... Just thinking that
people might misunderstand me...

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:56.600
My chest feels like it's
getting squeezed and it hurts.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:16:00.100
I can't keep this up... At this rate...

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:10.360
I just... can't connect with everyone.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.240
I'm sorry.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.790
Thank you.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:18.910
Huh?

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:23.750
Thank you for telling us how you really feel.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:27.630
Yeah, I'm grateful, too.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:34.130
I would love to see you perform, Rina-<i>chan</i>.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.970
So what if there are things you still can't do?

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:43.520
Right. You have so many things
you <i>can</i> do, Rina-<i>san</i>.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.230
--That's not...
--Like the fact that you're such a hard worker.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.690
You don't give up, either.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.400
You're awesome with tech.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.820
And you're very kind to animals.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.360
Hey!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.120
You just keep saying
awesome things about her! No fair!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:01.750
Okay, I'm getting in on this!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.540
W-Wait...

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.460
This is embarrassing...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.250
Rinako.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:15.180
The best idols are able to turn
their weaknesses into their strengths.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:21.600
Yeah, exactly! You just need to make up for
the stuff you can't do with stuff you can do!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.890
Let's think about this together.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.940
We still have time.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.150
Thank you.

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:37.570
This is the first time we were
able to talk like this, Rina-<i>san</i>.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.490
Oh, yeah. You're right.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.160
Is it because...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.050
I figured it out.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.640
There are so many people here!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:09.650
Tennoji-<i>san</i> didn't come to school yesterday.
I wonder if she's okay.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.030
Okay, you're all good!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:24.950
You can do this!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.420
Meow, meow!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.540
Is that...?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:38.630
Hello. I'm Rina Tennoji from
the Nijigasaki High School Idol Club.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:43.600
I'm about to put on the best
performance I can right now.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:46.600
I hope you all enjoy it.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.340
My heart is bouncing!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.050
Excitement takes flight!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.680
Now, let's connect!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:25.100
(I mean... No more hiding... )

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:30.440
(Changing... So I'm trying now)

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.190
Huh? I just tried to say what I was thinking

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.940
Wait, no that's not right (I, uh...)

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.650
I just can't get through, but why?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:41.320
What am I supposed to do again?
(Ah, ah, ah...)

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.740
My thinking's all a mess

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.120
Spinny, spinny, now loading

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.870
Wait, [Ctrl]+[Z] isn't working

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.250
Intricate customizations

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:52.540
If I could only install something
for what I was missing

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.210
It's so incomplete
(What's the right answer?)

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.710
It's so uncertain (Where is the answer?)

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.420
There's no manual for this, is there?

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:05.720
I guess I'll just have to
give this a shot...

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:08.470
A different form, a different shape

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.850
And yet why

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.520
Do I feel the same?? （⸝⸝>▿<⸝⸝）

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:14.400
This feeling that
we're connected (I love it)

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.730
Thank you for this warmth we share

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.490
I want to tell you
from the bottom of my heart

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:22.490
This colorful smile feels so cozy! ♪

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:25.280
I'm connecting with everyone (I love it)

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.330
This is the place that I love so much

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.410
My heart is bouncing!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.080
Excitement takes flight!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.670
Now, let's connect!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:39.130
(I mean... No more hiding... )

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:44.840
(Changing... So I'm trying now)

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.190
That was the best!

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.370
I was able to connect with everyone.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:17.210
Rina-<i>chan</i> Board... Teehee!

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:25.840
Good morning, Tennoji-<i>san</i>!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.800
Your concert was amazing!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.760
I want to tell you everything I felt about it!

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:33.230
Could we have lunch together today?

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.240
Yeah, I would love that.

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:11.010
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:14.890
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:21.730
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:24.530
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:28.490
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.410
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:41.880
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:49.970
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:54.350
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:22:54.350 --> 00:22:57.430
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:57.430 --> 00:23:01.940
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.570
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:07.820
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:16.290
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:20.500
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:26.300
Wake up, Kanata-<i>san</i>!

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:28.170
Please wake up!

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.300
The club's going to start! Kanata-<i>san</i>!

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:39.640
Next time, "Haruka, Kanata, and Beyond."
